  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object X collides with a stationary object Y on a frictionless surface. The <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>- and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"y\"></span>-components of the momentum of object X before and after the collision are recorded in the table below.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th></th><th>Momentum before collision / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{kg m s}^{-1}\"></span></th><th>Momentum after collision / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{kg m s}^{-1}\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>-component</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+12.0\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.0\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"y\"></span>-component</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.0\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+5.0\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the momentum of object Y after the collision?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"7.0 \\text{ kg m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"12.0 \\text{ kg m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"13.0 \\text{ kg m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"17.0 \\text{ kg m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
